  },
  {
    "id": "PSF-018401",
    "ref": "pge:7253-lz",
    "name": "Les 7 Meuses Landing",
    "lat": 50.3465,
    "lon": 4.8605,
    "wind": {},
    "altitude": 89.0,
    "sources": {
      "pge": "7253-lz"
    },
    "primary": "pge",
    "role": "landing",
    "tow": false,
    "group": [
      "pge:7253"
    ],
    "notes": "1) The two big fields in front of the take-off, between the camping and the speedway.  Donâ€™t fly above the camping at low altitude. Be careful, there are some high lighting posts along the road.  Donâ€™t leave the car on the parking of the bus company.\r\n\r\n2) Between the river and the 4 lines road just under the take-off on the right hand side.  Quite long but very narrow place.  It is strongly recommended to have a look at that place before your first flight.  The approach is quite technical and is realized above the river.   The wind is frequently changing and the air is usually sinking above the river.  Leave the car only on the parking on the other side of the road.\r\n\r\nIf you have enough altitude, you should preferably use the first of this landing place.  It is located few hundreds meters away from the road but it is definitively safer.",
    "url": "https://www.paraglidingearth.com/?site=7253"
  },
  {
    "id": "PSF-018422",
    "ref": "pge:7297-lz",
    "name": "Rochefort - Rond du Roi Landing",
    "lat": 50.1519,
    "lon": 5.2024,
    "wind": {},
    "altitude": 161.0,
    "sources": {
      "pge": "7297-lz"
    },
    "primary": "pge",
    "role": "landing",
    "tow": false,
    "group": [
      "pge:7297"
    ],
    "notes": "It is located just above the road N86 (in front of the Water-treatment plant).  Use the big prairies with windsocks.  Caution to the cows.  During the harvest only use prairies not cultivated.",
    "url": "https://www.paraglidingearth.com/?site=7297"
  }
